{
  "_comment": "Maps Stripe webhook event types to the generic revenue PaymentEvent shape consumed by the selected revenue projection: event_kind plus amount_due_today_cents, currency, recurring_amount_cents, subscription_status, and offer_id. The decoder reads these rows without app-specific branches; amounts are integer cents from Stripe.",
